                <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, alright.”</span> His dad chuckles, putting his hands up and stepping back, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just trying to help. Shirt can stay on. But you know, if you keep up these workouts, you may have some nice muscles to show off. Ladies love muscles.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> <span style="Color: Pink">facepalms and gives a look begging you to put him out of his misery, but you just give him an understanding smile.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alrighty! Let’s get back to it. Sing with me, come on, Left! Left! Lefty-righty-left!”</span> His father shouts out as he continues his jog, <span style="Color: Yellow">with the utterly exhausted and defeated <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> following behind, his attempt to explain his feelings utterly failing.</span> <br>
